1
00:00:00,133 --> 00:00:01,662
you might be thinking that UX research

2
00:00:01,662 --> 00:00:03,243
sounds like something that only big

3
00:00:03,243 --> 00:00:05,133
companies with big budgets can do

4
00:00:05,133 --> 00:00:07,782
but even as a small startup, some research

5
00:00:07,782 --> 00:00:09,703
is always better than no research

6
00:00:09,792 --> 00:00:10,583
you don't need a lab

7
00:00:10,583 --> 00:00:12,083
talk to five people who would actually use

8
00:00:12,083 --> 00:00:15,012
your product before you start to build maybe

9
00:00:15,012 --> 00:00:16,912
yourself and a few friends

10
00:00:17,242 --> 00:00:19,103
watch three of your friends try your app on

11
00:00:19,103 --> 00:00:20,203
a video call

12
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:21,683
with messages, with feedback

13
00:00:21,683 --> 00:00:23,783
that also counts, because good design goes

14
00:00:23,783 --> 00:00:26,353
so much deeper than just a nice visual

15
00:00:26,353 --> 00:00:28,303
it's about whether the thing actually works

16
00:00:28,303 --> 00:00:29,700
